  "_README": [
    "HAND-MAINTAINED. APA's API carries regular-season league matches only — playoffs and",
    "tournaments are scored on paper, so none of this exists upstream. The pipeline never",
    "writes this file; edit it by hand and re-run build_site_data.py.",
    "",
    "Source: Casey's recollection + notes from the previous captain (2026-09-03).",
    "",
    "SCORE CONVENTION (confirmed by Casey 2026-09-03): scoreRaw is MATCH POINTS, not racks,",
    "and it is always OUR PLAYER FIRST. Casey's readings:",
    "  3-0  won, opponent shut out",
    "  2-1  won, but the opponent got to the hill",
    "  0-3  lost, shut out",
    "  0-2  lost, without reaching the hill",
    "Only the win/loss half is treated as certain; the app shows the raw string alongside its",
    "reading rather than converting scores into any derived stat.",
    "",
    "OPEN: 0-2 and 0-3 are both described as losses short of the hill, so the two do not",
    "separate cleanly. Left as written rather than reconciled by guesswork."
